// UBI: 10 GBP per tick into pop 0's currency inventory, plus two steps in the
// magic producer's supply.
//
// `inv` is a raw InventoryId. The loader assigns them in order — buildings, then
// employed pops, then unemployed stubs (scenario/raw.rs) — so with 5 buildings
// here, pop 0's inventory is index 5. Note this index is positional: adding a
// building silently retargets the injection. The tape format should reference
// pops symbolically (worldgen.md); until it does, edit these together.
//
// `prov: Event` marks this as a tape injection: an unpaired mint, currency
// entering with no counterparty giving it up. Without the tag the conservation
// ledger panics on money appearing from nowhere.
(
    events: [
        (149, [
            SetMagicProducerQty(
                id: (0),
                qty: 15.0,
            ),
        ]),
        (249, [
            SetMagicProducerQty(
                id: (0),
                qty: 16.0,
            ),
        ]),
    ],
    recurring: [
        (1, [
            AddToInventory(
                inv: (5),
                good: (2),
                qty: 10.0,
                prov: Event,
            ),
        ]),
    ],
)
